ze="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="288" x="1174" y="316.4761">EC2 c2 (AWS Academy, presupuesto de 50 USD en</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="242" x="1174" y="329.2808">créditos) aloja en un solo nodo el servidor</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="264" x="1174" y="342.0854">WSGI, la aplicación Django y la base de datos.</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="223" x="1174" y="354.8901">AMI de Linux, certificado HTTPS básico,</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="260" x="1174" y="367.6948">respaldos programados (RNF-010: RPO 24 h /</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="241" x="1174" y="380.4995">RTO 4 h). Motor de base de datos aún por</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="198" x="1174" y="393.3042">definir (PostgreSQL u otra opción).</text><path d="M877,994.4609 L877,1145.3125 A0,0 0 0 0 877,1145.3125 L1162,1145.3125 A0,0 0 0 0 1162,1145.3125 L1162,1004.4609 L1152,994.4609 L1023.5,994.4609 L1019.5,931.4709 L1015.5,994.4609 L877,994.4609 A0,0 0 0 0 877,994.4609 " fill="#FEF9C3" style="stroke: #CA8A04; stroke-width: 1.0;"/><path d="M1152,994.4609 L1152,1004.4609 L1162,1004.4609 L1152,994.4609 " fill="#FEF9C3" style="stroke: #CA8A04; stroke-width: 1.0;"/><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" font-weight="bold" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="46" x="883" y="1009.6714">Óptimo</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="166" x="933" y="1009.6714">(actividad-2.md §2.2): misma</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="230" x="883" y="1022.4761">instancia EC2 c2 — sin escalar a un tipo</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="231" x="883" y="1035.2808">mayor ni a múltiples instancias, para no</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="244" x="883" y="1048.0854">exceder el crédito disponible — agregando</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="247" x="883" y="1060.8901">certificado HTTPS reforzado (Let's Encrypt),</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="264" x="883" y="1073.6948">backups más frecuentes y esta réplica de BD.</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="215" x="883" y="1086.4995">No se incluyen balanceador de carga,</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="246" x="883" y="1099.3042">orquestador de contenedores ni monitoreo</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="228" x="883" y="1112.1089">dedicado: el sistema es de uso interno,</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="244" x="883" y="1124.9136">restringido a funcionarios municipales, sin</text><text fill="#000000" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="11" lengthAdjust="spacingAndGlyphs" textLength="257" x="883" y="1137.7183">necesidad de escalar ante alta concurrencia.</text><!--MD5=[5398f6cfac64741372b3e3dc93b0d679]
